//! name: two-terminators-in-one-block
//! expect: verify-reject
//! code: TwoTerminators
// `br` is written as the block's first line, not its last, so it lands in
// the regular instruction range while `unreachable` becomes `term` --
// see block.rs's module docs for why this is what "two terminators" means.

decl 5 sig 1
block bb0
do br bb1
do unreachable
block bb1
do unreachable
